IBM Plex fonts (vendored)
========================

These woff2 files are served from this directory so the app never loads a font from the
network. Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (LICENSE-IBM-Plex.txt, copyright IBM Corp.).

Sources (fetched once at build time with `npm pack`; no tarball and no node_modules committed):
  @fontsource/ibm-plex-sans@5.3.0   Latin and Latin-ext Sans, weights 400 and 600
  @fontsource/ibm-plex-mono@5.3.0   Latin and Latin-ext Mono, weight 400
  @ibm/plex-sans@1.1.0              Greek Sans split files, Regular (400) and SemiBold (600)

The files are byte-identical to the package files. They were only renamed. The unicode-range
values in plex.css are copied verbatim from the Fontsource 5.3.0 CSS for the same subsets
(Greek uses U+0370-03FF).

